      "text": "My racing pulse has found a brand-new range"
    },
    {
      "start": 92.2,
      "end": 94.9,
      "text": "Darling, I'm yours; desire keeps me uncool"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.9,
      "end": 98.14,
      "text": "Those frosty manners overturn each rule"
    },
    {
